727c3ba6534a7a2cbb4a215ee587.poster.avif?t=1553732166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970610/extras/0c27727c3ba6534a7a2cbb4a215ee587.webm?t=1553732166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/970610/extras/0c27727c3ba6534a7a2cbb4a215ee587.mp4?t=1553732166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Checkmate! Shout out your win to the opponent by using unique hero skills and units with your style!",
